### Read a user by id
GET http://localhost:4000/user-api/user


### POST create a user document
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dspr",
  "email": "dspr@gmail.com",
  "password": "gfghg"
}

### PUT updating a user by id
PUT http://localhost:4000/user-api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sidhu",
  "email": "sidhu@gmail.com",
  "password": "sidhu1234",
  "age":18
}

### DELETE a user by id
DELETE http://localhost:4000/user-api/users/69b2ba2b2d768dda0d95b0a9


###USER LOGIN 
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":"dspr@gmail.com",
  "password":"gfghg"
}

###add product to user cart
PUT http://localhost:4000/user-api/cart/product-id/







###PRODUCTS
### Read all Products
GET http://localhost:4000/product-api/products

### Read a products by id
GET http://localhost:4000/product-api/products/1


###create a product
POST http://localhost:4000/product-api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId":1,
  "productName": "laptop",
  "price": 30000,
  "brand":"acer"
}

###updating a product by productId
PUT http://localhost:4000/product-api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId":1,
  "productName": "tv",
  "price": 30000,
  "brand":"lg"
}

### DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:4000/product-api/products/1
